# Property ROI Analysis Tool — Duration/Lead-Time Seed Table v1.0

**Artifact:** Duration/Lead-Time Seed Table  
**Version:** v1.0  
**Date:** June 2026  
**Status:** Draft seed-table artifact; owner-approved direction with row-level source QA still required  
**Prepared by:** Manus AI  
**Governing Sources:** PRD v0.8, Decisions Log V11, Technical Specification V2, Static Data Source Register V1, Home Improvement Project Duration Estimates

## 1. Purpose

This artifact converts the 13 previously missing duration and lead-time repair types into a governed seed-table format for the Scarcity-Aware Seller Action Sequencer. These rows support schedule feasibility, target-list-date warnings, carrying-cost logic, and the placement of recommendations into main-plan, urgent, constrained, beyond-timeline, or not-recommended categories.

Decisions Log V11 formally approved two important changes: **Accessibility improvements must be split into subtypes**, and **professional staging must trigger a timeline anomaly when the target list date is fewer than 21 days away**.[1]

